{"page":320,"width":1651,"height":2480,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"378","words":[{"text":"378","x":181,"y":137,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"8.9","words":[{"text":"8.9","x":182,"y":264,"width":87,"height":35}]},{"text":"Chapter 8 교착 상대","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":306,"y":139,"width":112,"height":27},{"text":"8","x":430,"y":138,"width":20,"height":22},{"text":"교착","x":477,"y":139,"width":40,"height":24},{"text":"상대","x":525,"y":141,"width":40,"height":24}]},{"text":"요약 summary","words":[{"text":"요약","x":307,"y":261,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"summary","x":404,"y":272,"width":154,"height":29}]},{"text":"• 집합의 모든 프로세스가 같은 집합의 다른 프로세스에서만 발생할 수 있는 이벤트를","words":[{"text":"•","x":326,"y":360,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"집합의","x":366,"y":352,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":461,"y":353,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"프로세스가","x":529,"y":351,"width":143,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":683,"y":351,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"집합의","x":751,"y":352,"width":81,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":846,"y":352,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스에서만","x":914,"y":352,"width":212,"height":35},{"text":"발생할","x":1138,"y":352,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1246,"y":353,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":1293,"y":353,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"이벤트를","x":1371,"y":354,"width":127,"height":35}]},{"text":"기다리는 경우 프로세스 집힙쉬1서 교착 성1해까 발생한다.","words":[{"text":"기다리는","x":365,"y":408,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":492,"y":409,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스","x":557,"y":409,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"집힙쉬1서","x":683,"y":408,"width":108,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":805,"y":409,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"성1해까","x":873,"y":408,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"발생한다.","x":972,"y":408,"width":127,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 교착 상대에 필요한 네 가지 조건이 있다. (1) 상호 배제, (2) 점유하며 대기, (3) 비","words":[{"text":"•","x":325,"y":485,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"교착","x":362,"y":476,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"상대에","x":433,"y":475,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"필요한","x":532,"y":475,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"네","x":629,"y":475,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":669,"y":475,"width":52,"height":35},{"text":"조건이","x":736,"y":475,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":836,"y":475,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"(1)","x":912,"y":478,"width":37,"height":34},{"text":"상호","x":964,"y":474,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"배제,","x":1037,"y":475,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"(2)","x":1120,"y":478,"width":39,"height":34},{"text":"점유하며","x":1177,"y":475,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"대기,","x":1321,"y":476,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"(3)","x":1410,"y":480,"width":41,"height":34},{"text":"비","x":1469,"y":478,"width":25,"height":34}]},{"text":"선점 및 (4) 순환 대기. 교착 상태는 네 가지 조건이 모두 존재할 때만 기능하다.","words":[{"text":"선점","x":362,"y":533,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"및","x":432,"y":533,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"(4)","x":470,"y":535,"width":35,"height":34},{"text":"순환","x":517,"y":532,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"대기.","x":586,"y":532,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":660,"y":532,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"상태는","x":726,"y":532,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"네","x":823,"y":533,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":862,"y":531,"width":53,"height":36},{"text":"조건이","x":929,"y":531,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"모두","x":1030,"y":534,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"존재할","x":1103,"y":532,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"때만","x":1211,"y":533,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"기능하다.","x":1288,"y":533,"width":138,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 교착 상태는 자원 할당 그래프를 A卜용하여 모델링 할 수 있다. 여기서 사이클은 교착","words":[{"text":"•","x":323,"y":608,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"교착","x":361,"y":600,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"상태는","x":430,"y":600,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"자원","x":527,"y":599,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"할당","x":593,"y":599,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"그래프를","x":660,"y":599,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"A卜용하여","x":784,"y":599,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"모델링","x":910,"y":598,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":1011,"y":599,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":1052,"y":600,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":1097,"y":600,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"여기서","x":1180,"y":600,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"사이클은","x":1288,"y":600,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"교착","x":1433,"y":602,"width":64,"height":34}]},{"text":"상태를 가리킨다.","words":[{"text":"상태를","x":361,"y":657,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"가리킨다.","x":459,"y":656,"width":119,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 교착 상태에 필요한 4가지 조건 중 하나가 발생하지 않도록 하여 교착 상태를 예방","words":[{"text":"•","x":323,"y":734,"width":13,"height":14},{"text":"교착","x":359,"y":725,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"상태에","x":431,"y":724,"width":82,"height":36},{"text":"필요한","x":529,"y":723,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"4가지","x":624,"y":724,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"조건","x":710,"y":724,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"중","x":779,"y":725,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"하나가","x":820,"y":724,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"발생하지","x":920,"y":724,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"않도록","x":1054,"y":724,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"하여","x":1161,"y":726,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"교착","x":1239,"y":727,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"상태를","x":1319,"y":727,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"예방","x":1434,"y":728,"width":62,"height":35}]},{"text":"할 수 있다. 필요한 네 가지 조건 중 순환 대기를 제거하는 것이 유일한 현실적인 접","words":[{"text":"할","x":358,"y":783,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":400,"y":784,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":441,"y":782,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"필요한","x":517,"y":781,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"네","x":613,"y":782,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":652,"y":781,"width":52,"height":35},{"text":"조건","x":718,"y":781,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"중","x":786,"y":783,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"순환","x":826,"y":782,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"대기를","x":897,"y":782,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"제거하는","x":997,"y":782,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":